<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Holy Priest Healer in Wrath of the Lich King Classic for Phase 3. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from Heroics, reputation rewards, and the new 10-man Raid loot added to Titan Rune Dungeons.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-gear">Holy Priest Healer Best in Slot Gear, Gems, and Enchants - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>While they are definitely not required for setting foot in your first raid, there are a handful of fairly valueable items you can aim for to catch up to the current tier of raiding as soon as possible. Among these, the ones with the most staying power are likely the rings, necklace and boots listed in the embed below, which are powerful enough to compete with nearly all options other than the extremely contested item level 258 alternatives.<br/>
<br/>Although you will and also should realistically begin raiding before assembling the set below, you will most certainly be geared enough to heal any raid of the current tier on heroic difficulty without any problems using this gearset.<br/>
<br/>Even though the four piece bonus of the tier 8 set barely benefits Holy, these items are still used due to the lack of good offpieces available pre-raid. That said, the 2p bonus can definitely come in handy on fights that allow for some PoH usage.<br/>
<br/>
