<br/>
<br/>Since Holy can make good use of just about all caster stats, the new crafted items are fairly well itemized for us and definitely worth picking up if they're cheap enough<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47585/bejeweled-wizards-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bejeweled Wizard's Bracers</span></a> in particular is the strongest pair of bracers available outside of the two extremely contested 258 options from ToGC, so you will likely end up using them for a quite a while if you decide to opt for them. Other than that, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47605/royal-moonshroud-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_75.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Royal Moonshroud Robe</span></a> is another great piece that can easily hold you over until you get an actual heroic alternative out of T9 content.<br/>
<br/>Finally, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45557/sash-of-ancient-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sash of Ancient Power</span></a> has a handful of possible upgrades, but should be fairly affordable at this point.<br/>
<br/>Nonetheless, grinding out pieces of gear for every slot in the Titan Rune dungeons will likely be more worthwhile than spending your gold on these pieces and neglecting the rest of your gear, so carefully consider whether or not you want to opt for them.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-gems">Best Gems for Holy Priest Healer - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Meta Socket - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41401/insightful-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Insightful Earthsiege Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Red Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40155/reckless-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ametrine</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40113/runed-cardinal-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Cardinal Ruby</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40133/purified-dreadstone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Dreadstone</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40128/quick-kings-amber">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quick King's Amber</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40155/reckless-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ametrine</span></a></div></li></ul>With <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41401/insightful-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Insightful Earthsiege Diamond</span></a> providing a large amount of mana regeneration at the opportunity cost of fairly little spell power, it's your go-to meta choice for the rest of the expansion.<br/>
<br/>Since Holy can make good use of most stats, there are several valid ways to gem. You can either fully opt for haste or spell power gems outside of activating your meta gem or alternatively go for gem bonuses to get more stats altogether. If sustain is an issue, slotting some pure intellect gems is also an option, but more considerate spell usage is another way to deal with that.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-enchants">Best Enchants for Holy Priest Healer - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>
